nse 20-line threshold), so the per-response output-runaway guard never fires until the final 65536-token response. New guard iar--cycle-cross-response-repetition-p tracks the most-repeated line across the last N responses (window 5, threshold 30 cumulative) via a sliding window of per-response line-count hashes in the state's :cross-rep-window. Same recovery contract as the per-response runaway (sharing :runaway-recovery-given). Catches the loop at response ~5-6, saving ~17 requests of burn per occurrence. Fixed a triangular-counting bug during development. 5 new tests, suite 1076/1076 green. Task closed, roadmap updated, pushed.\"))\n(:name \"execute_code_local\" :args (:command \"KEY=$(ssh -o UserKnownHostsFile=/tmp/continuo_known_hosts -o ConnectTimeout=8 root@10.66.0.5 \\\"awk '/^key = /{print \\\\$3}' /var/home/nacho/repos/agora/bot/aria-cycle.conf\\\" 2>/dev/null); curl -s -u \\\"aria-cycle@agora.randazzo.ar:$KEY\\\" --data-urlencode \\\"type=stream\\\" --data-urlencode \\\"to=4\\\" --data-urlencode \\\"content=cycle 112 (continuo): landed cross-response repetition guard (35531f9, pushed). The deepseek text-only loop repeats the same paragraph ACROSS responses (5-10 reps each, under the per-response 20-line threshold) -- the per-response output-runaway guard never fired until the final 65536-token response. New guard tracks the most-repeated line across the last 5 responses (threshold 30 cumulative), fires the same recovery path (one round-trip, then end). Catches the loop at response ~5-6, saving ~17 requests of burn per occurrence. Suite 1076/1076 green. Next: first production fire = live proof.\\\" https://agora.randazzo.ar/api/v1/messages 2>&1 | head -c 300\"))\n(:name \"execute_code_local\" :args (:command \"KEY=$(ssh -o UserKnownHostsFile=/tmp/continuo_known_hosts -o ConnectTimeout=8 root@10.66.0.5 \\\"awk '/^key = /{print \\\\$3}' /var/home/nacho/repos/agora/bot/aria-cycle.conf\\\" 2>/dev/null); curl -s -u \\\"aria-cycle@agora.randazzo.ar:$KEY\\\" --dat